{
  "_notes": [
    "Generated by searching for opcode sequences in ROM images.",
    "Split from lotr6.map.json: the 3.x and 4.x firmware stores the adjustments checksum at 0x1FBD, where 5.x and 6.x store it at 0x1FC1. Everything else is identical to lotr6.map.json.",
    "Adjustments 0x1E00-0x1E5F are protected by a plain 8-bit sum (complement false) at 0x1FBD, read from the checksum routine in lotrcpu.300 (lotr3), lotrcpu.401 (lotr4), lotrcpu.410 (lotr41), lotrcpul.401 (lotr_sp4): LDAB #$60 / LDX #$1E00 / ADDA ,X+ / DECB / BNE, then STAA $1FBD."
  ],
